<title>ITALY: Esso Italiana raises Sarpom stake to 72.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Esso Italiana raises Sarpom stake to 72.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Esso Italiana, a subsidiary of the U.S. oil giant Exxon Corp, said it will increase its stake in refinery group Sarpom SpA to 72.8 perrcent from 65.7 percent.</p>
<p>In a note, Esso Italiana said it intends to exercise an option to acquire the Sarpom shares from Maxcom. According to oil industry sources the total 9.7 percent stake held by Maxcom in Sarpom is valued at around 20-27 billion lire.</p>
<p>Oil group Erg holds a 2.7 percent stake in Sarpom, and the industry sources said Erg may sell its Sarpom stake to Esso Italiana, but Erg's official position over the stake is not known.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
